'''Sound''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|1,700,000}} or {{Robux|1,900}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Sound enables the user to control and manipulate sound, mainly by launching a barrage of musical notes to attack foes. When enhanced by a fully charged Tempo Meter, it allows the player and their allies to gain buffs, increasing their strength and speed.

