==Overview==
<tabber>
Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* All moves have [[AoE]].
* Great for grinding.
* Great in "crew wars" (PvP scenarios with teammates and an opponent team), as {{Ability|F}} also buffs nearby allies while providing decent mobility, especially in air.
* Deals more damage with Tempo Meter, which is not hard to fill
* Has a huge hitbox and [[AoE]].
* Great for raids, both as a support and for damaging raid enemies.
* All moves except [F] can damage [[Sea Beasts]].
* Most moves break [[Instinct]] no matter what.

|'''[Z] Rhapsody Notes'''
* The move can be used three times consecutively, and has a 10 second cooldown.
* Almost no knockback.

|'''[X] Fortissimo'''
* Decent damage and knockback.

|'''[C] Symphonic Radiance'''
* Decent knockback.
* Large AoE.
* Auto-aim
* Good for grouping enemies.

|'''[V] Glorious Harmony'''
* Huge AoE, therefore, it can hugely affect crowds of people/NPCs.
* High damage.
* Greatly distorting, both to the enemy and the user, making it both a pro and a con.
* Can escape enemy combos well because the projectiles stay around for a while.

|'''[F] Tempo: Prestissimo'''
* Great mobility.
* Decent speed.
* Refills Tempo Meter during flight.
* Increases speed when the user is at low [[health]].
}}

|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* Slow cooldowns.
* All moves are really weak in stuns and combos.

|'''[Z] Rhapsody Notes'''
* It is not guaranteed to deal full damage because of the certain distance between each projectile.
* Players can easily predict when the player will spam the move, making it less viable for PvP.

|'''[X] Fortissimo'''
* Small range.
* Decent end-lag.

|'''[C] Symphonic Radiance'''
* No stun, making it easy to escape.
* Damage dealt to an enemy using this move is dramatically reduced if it hits them multiple times in one use.
* Beams from this move shoot randomly and does not stack on one player.

|'''[V] Glorious Harmony'''
* Decent end-lag.
* Small attraction range.
* Final projectile has long startup.
** It is also hard to aim if the enemy is quick enough to evade.

|'''[F] Tempo: Prestissimo'''
* The flight is slow before getting max Tempo Meter.
* Needs a long time to get faster flight.
}}
</tabber>

